7. Other components
-------------------

SPIM's parser and scanner are generated from CPU/parser.y and CPU/scanner.l by
GNU Bison (whose special exception applies to the generated parser) and flex
(whose license puts no condition on generated scanners); acknowledged in
electron/native/LICENSE.flex.txt.

The npm packages bundled into the program's JavaScript (CodeMirror and its
dependencies, iconv-lite, safer-buffer) and node-addon-api (compiled into the
addon), all under the MIT License. Their list and license texts are generated
at build time (electron/tools/licenses.ts) and shown in About > Licenses.


